# 3. AWS Infrastructure Management

Always clean up AWS resources to avoid unnecessary costs.

Resources to check:

- EC2 Instances
- EBS Volumes
- Elastic IPs
- Load Balancers
- Auto Scaling Groups
- Snapshots
- Security Groups (unused)

